  "selectionGuide": {
    "brief": "정찰 · 섬멸 — 편성 1+9 = 10명",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "HUNTER CLADE KILL TEAM"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "ARCHETYPE: RECON, SEEK & DESTROY"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "OPERATIVES"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "↘ 1 HUNTER CLADE operative selected from the following list:\n• SICARIAN INFILTRATOR PRINCEPS with one option from each of the following:\n○ Flechette blaster or stubcarbine\n○ Power weapon or taser goad\n• SICARIAN RUSTSTALKER PRINCEPS\n• SKITARII RANGER ALPHA with one of the following options:\n○ Galvanic rifle; gun butt\n○ Master-crafted radium pistol; power weapon\nOr one option from each of the following:\n○ Arc pistol or phosphor blast pistol\n○ Arc maul or taser goad\n• SKITARII VANGUARD ALPHA with one of the following options:\n○ Radium carbine; gun butt\n○ Master-crafted radium pistol; power weapon\nOr one option from each of the following:\n○ Arc pistol or phosphor blast pistol\n○ Arc maul or taser goad"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "↘ 9 HUNTER CLADE operatives selected from the following list:\n• SICARIAN INFILTRATOR WARRIOR with one option from each of the following:\n○ Flechette blaster or stubcarbine\n○ Power weapon or taser goad\n• SICARIAN RUSTSTALKER WARRIOR with one of the following options:\n○ Chordclaw & transonic razor\n○ Transonic blades\n• SKITARII RANGER DIKTAT\n• SKITARII RANGER GUNNER with gun butt and one of the following options:\n○ Arc rifle, plasma caliver or transuranic arquebus\n• SKITARII RANGER SURVEYOR\n• SKITARII RANGER WARRIOR\n• SKITARII VANGUARD DIKTAT\n• SKITARII VANGUARD GUNNER with gun butt and one of the following options:\n○ Arc rifle, plasma caliver or transuranic arquebus\n• SKITARII VANGUARD SURVEYOR\n• SKITARII VANGUARD WARRIOR"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Other than GUNNER and WARRIOR operatives, your kill team can only include each operative on this list once. Your kill team can only include up to one DIKTAT operative, up to one SURVEYOR operative and up to five SICARIAN operatives. Your kill team can only include up to one arc rifle, up to one plasma caliver and up to one transuranic arquebus."
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "You cannot select more than seven of these operatives combined."
      }
    ]
  },
  "factionRule": {
    "brief": "DOCTRINA IMPERATIVES",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "DOCTRINA IMPERATIVES"
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Tech-Priests dictate protocols for the Hunter Clade to follow as they move through their mission, straining the programming of the Skitarii and Sicarians in order to optimise their current status, to the detriment of all else. At the end of the Select Operatives step, select one DOCTRINA IMPERATIVE to be a Primary Mode for your kill team until the end of the battle (note that selecting a Primary Mode doesn't automatically give you the effects of that DOCTRINA IMPERATIVE for the battle; you must still select it as a STRATEGIC GAMBIT, as below). STRATEGIC GAMBIT. Select one DOCTRINA IMPERATIVE for friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives to have until the Ready step of the next Strategy phase. Each DOCTRINA IMPERATIVE has both an Optimisation and a Deprecation rule. Both are in effect while your kill team has that DOCTRINA IMPERATIVE. Once per battle, when you select the DOCTRINA IMPERATIVE that's your kill team's Primary Mode, you can ignore its Deprecation rule."
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Protector Imperative Optimisation: Friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives' ranged weapons have the Ceaseless weapon rule. Deprecation: Worsen the Hit stat of friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives' melee weapons by"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "1. This isn't cumulative with being injured."
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Conqueror Imperative Optimisation: Friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives' melee weapons have the Ceaseless weapon rule. Deprecation: Worsen the Hit stat of friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives' ranged weapons by"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "1. This isn't cumulative with being injured."
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Bulwark Imperative Optimisation: Normal Dmg of 3 or more inflicts 1 less damage on friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives. Deprecation: Subtract 1\" from the Move stat of friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives."
      },
      {
        "type": "rule",
        "text": "Aggressor Imperative Optimisation: Add 1\" to the Move stat of friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives. Deprecation: Worsen the Save stat of friendly HUNTER CLADE operatives by 1."
      },
      {
        "type": "lore",
        "text": "Neutral Imperative Optimisation: None. Deprecation: None."
      }
    ]
  },
  "source": "공식 Kill Team 앱 PDF 추출본"
}
